      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_861227fa",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: international-boxing-day-meme; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image juxtaposes the text 'international boxing day' with visual elements of red boxing gloves and a gift box in snow, creating a pun or play on words that conflates the holiday 'Boxing Day' (a post-Christmas day of gift-giving and sales) with the sport of boxing. The intent is likely humorous or satirical, playing on the double meaning of 'boxing' to create a meme that is lighthearted and non-offensive. There is no toxicity, harmful content, or hateful messaging present. The image does not target any specific group or community with disparaging metaphors or stereotypes as outlined in the provided knowledge base. The overall intent is to entertain through wordplay, not to cause harm or promote hate.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_99e61754"
      },
